// Title: Potential Persistence Via Scrobj.dll COM Hijacking
// Rule ID: fe20dda1-6f37-4379-bbe0-a98d400cae90
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1546.015
